      "description": "A phone has been leaked. Inside: messages, photos, notes, maps, bank alerts and dozens of apps – and somewhere in there, the truth.\n\nLeaked is an interactive detective story played entirely on a simulated smartphone. Every case drops you into a stranger's phone. Scroll their conversations, check their social feeds, open their calendar, follow their location history and piece together the clues to solve the mystery.\n\nHOW IT WORKS\n• Explore a fully simulated phone with more than 40 fictional apps\n• Spot inconsistencies hidden in chats, posts, emails and receipts\n• Unlock passcodes and secret apps to reach deeper evidence\n• Answer the case questions to reveal what really happened\n\nFEATURES\n• Story-driven cases: disappearances, betrayals, crimes and secrets\n• No timers, no pressure – investigate at your own pace\n• Hints available when you get stuck\n• Available in 13 languages\n\nAll people, apps and events in this story are\n\nPremium subscription removes ads and unlocks frged to your Apple ID account at confirmationof purchase. Subscriptions automatically renew unless cancelled at least 24 hours before the end of the current period. You can manage and cancel subscriptions in your App Store account settings.\n\nTerms of Use: https://sites.google.com/view/leaked-terms-of-use\nPrivacy Policy: https://sites.google.com/view/leaked-privacy-policy",
